Whole grain bread for toasts and sandwiches, sliced. Ingredients: 51% whole wheat flour; water; wheat bran (Dobrudzha); baker's yeast; sunflower oil; barley malt flour ;

Origin of the flour: Bulgaria. 

May contain traces of sesame seeds ; soy and walnuts ; 
Palm oil fre ; 
No palm oil ; 

Store in a cool and well-ventilated place,
protected from direct sunlight.

Spanish: •Mistura de cereais integras 60% (flocos laminados de aveia, trigo e centeio);
•Sultanas 15%,
•Mistura de frutos de casca rija e amendoins 7% (avelãs, amendoins, amêndoas);
•Sementes 5% (linhaça, girassol);
•Coco ralado;
•Floco de milho tostado 2% (milho, açúcar, sal, extrato de malte de cevada).
